From: GloriousEggroll <gloriouseggroll@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mf: Reallocate transform output samples after dropping seek preroll.

When mark-in discards a sample preceding a seek target, it releases the
sample and clears pSample. Retrying ProcessOutput with the same descriptors
violates the contract of transforms requiring caller-allocated output.

In the VRChat HLS reproduction, resuming seeks to 209.8437652 seconds. The
AAC decoder produces earlier preroll, which mark-in drops. The following
call has no output buffer, returns E_FAIL, and stops audio sample requests;
the audio-driven presentation clock then stops as well.

Release and reset all output descriptors, allocate replacement samples,
and reset the status before retrying. Keep stream-change handling and
transform-provided sample allocation unchanged. Extend the session seek
test to require fresh samples while discarding two preroll outputs.

diff --git a/dlls/mf/session.c b/dlls/mf/session.c
--- a/dlls/mf/session.c
+++ b/dlls/mf/session.c
@@ -3839,10 +3839,9 @@
     if (FAILED(hr = allocate_output_samples(session, node, buffers)))
         goto done;
 
-    status = 0;
-
-    do
+    for (;;)
     {
+        status = 0;
         hr = IMFTransform_ProcessOutput(node->object.transform, 0, node->u.transform.output_count, buffers, &status);
         if (hr == MF_E_TRANSFORM_STREAM_CHANGE && SUCCEEDED(hr = transform_node_format_changed(node, buffers)))
         {
@@ -3854,8 +3853,17 @@
 
             hr = IMFTransform_ProcessOutput(node->object.transform, 0, node->u.transform.output_count, buffers, &status);
         }
+
+        if (hr != S_OK || !transform_node_markin_need_more_input(session, node, buffers))
+            break;
+
+        /* Mark-in releases preroll samples. Caller-allocated transforms still
+         * need an output sample on the next attempt to drain the decoder. */
+        release_output_samples(node, buffers);
+        memset(buffers, 0, node->u.transform.output_count * sizeof(*buffers));
+        if (FAILED(hr = allocate_output_samples(session, node, buffers)))
+            goto done;
     }
-    while (hr == S_OK && transform_node_markin_need_more_input(session, node, buffers));
 
     if (hr == MF_E_TRANSFORM_NEED_MORE_INPUT)
         node->flags |= TOPO_NODE_TRANSFORM_NEEDS_INPUT;
